<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fa" dir="rtl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>برومند پرور 🐸</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Vazirmatn:wght@400;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  font-family: 'Vazirmatn', Tahoma, sans-serif;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0a1f0a, #0a0a0a);
  color: #e0e0e0;
  line-height: 1.9;
  direction: rtl;
  min-height: 100vh;
  position: relative;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}
body::before {
  content: '';
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(3px 3px at 15% 20%, #4ade80, transparent),
    radial-gradient(2px 2px at 70% 60%, #4ade80, transparent),
    radial-gradient(2px 2px at 85% 15%, #22c55e, transparent),
    radial-gradient(2px 2px at 40% 85%, #4ade80, transparent),
    radial-gradient(3px 3px at 90% 80%, #22c55e, transparent),
    radial-gradient(2px 2px at 25% 70%, #86efac, transparent);
  opacity: 0.4;
  animation: twinkle 5s infinite alternate;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 0;
}
@keyframes twinkle { from { opacity: 0.2; } to { opacity: 0.6; } }
@keyframes jump {
  0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) rotate(-3deg); }
  50% { transform: translateY(-20px) rotate(3deg); }
}
header {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 50px 20px 30px;
}
.frog {
  font-size: 6rem;
  display: inline-block;
  animation: jump 1.5s infinite;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 30px rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.8));
}
header h1 {
  font-size: 2.3rem;
  font-weight: 900;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #86efac, #4ade80, #22c55e);
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  background-clip: text;
  margin: 15px 0 10px;
}
header .subtitle {
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  color: #86efac;
  font-weight: 700;
}
header .tagline {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: #888;
  margin-top: 8px;
}
section {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 30px 20px;
}
h2 {
  font-size: 1.6rem;
  color: #4ade80;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  text-align: center;
  text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.5);
}
h2::after {
  content: '';
  display: block;
  width: 70px;
  height: 3px;
  background: #4ade80;
  margin: 12px auto 0;
  border-radius: 3px;
}
.info-box {
  background: rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.08);
  border: 2px solid rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.3);
  border-radius: 15px;
  padding: 25px;
  text-align: center;
  margin: 15px 0;
}
.info-box .label {
  color: #86efac;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  margin-bottom: 5px;
}
.info-box .value {
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 1.3rem;
  font-weight: 900;
}
.father-section {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.15), rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.05));
  border: 2px solid #4ade80;
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 35px 25px;
  text-align: center;
  margin: 30px auto;
  max-width: 800px;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
  box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.2);
}
.father-section .father-icon {
  font-size: 3rem;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.father-section h2 {
  color: #4ade80;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}
.father-section .thanks {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  color: #86efac;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-top: 15px;
  padding-top: 15px;
  border-top: 2px dashed rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.4);
}
.father-section .thanks span {
  display: inline-block;
  animation: jump 2s infinite;
}
.contact-btns {
  display: flex;
  gap: 15px;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-top: 20px;
}
.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 14px 30px;
  background: transparent;
  border: 2px solid #4ade80;
  color: #4ade80;
  border-radius: 50px;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: 700;
  transition: all 0.3s;
  font-size: 1rem;
}
.btn:hover {
  background: #4ade80;
  color: #0a0a0a;
  box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.7);
}
footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 40px 20px 30px;
  color: #555;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
footer .made-with {
  color: #4ade80;
  font-weight: 700;
}
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  header h1 { font-size: 1.7rem; }
  .frog { font-size: 4.5rem; }
  .father-section .thanks { font-size: 1rem; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <div class="frog">🐸</div>
    <h1>برومند پرور</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">🥒 دانش‌آموز پایه نهم 🥒</p>
    <p class="tagline">به سایت شخصی من خوش آمدید 🐸</p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2>🐸 درباره من</h2>
    <div class="info-box">
      <div class="label">نام و نام خانوادگی</div>
      <div class="value">برومند پرور</div>
    </div>
    <div class="info-box">
      <div class="label">مقطع تحصیلی</div>
      <div class="value">پایه نهم</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="father-section">
    <div class="father-icon">👨</div>
    <h2>بخش پدر</h2>
    <div class="thanks">
      <span>🙏</span> با تشکر از احالی محل <span>🙏</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section>
    <h2>💬 ارتباط با من</h2>
    <p style="text-align:center; color:#bbb; margin-bottom:15px;">
      آیدی بله من:
    </p>
    <div class="info-box">
      <div class="value">@mamad_aizen</div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-btns">
      <a href="https://ble.ir/mamad_aizen" class="btn">💬 پیام در بله</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    ساخته شده با <span class="made-with">❤️</span> و کمک هوش مصنوعی<br>
    <small>— سایت شخصی برومند پرور —</small>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
